repository-code: "[TO THE AUTHOR: repository URL once created]"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation for the coupling of a finite-element subdomain to a
  network-represented subdomain through a self-adjoint discrete interface operator,
  with an exact energy-matching criterion for the interface allocation.  Includes the
  numerical artefacts behind every table and figure together with the auditors used
  to check the manuscript.
